# RAHSA CAFE — Art Credits

All 3D models are genuine hand-made work by independent artists, used under
permissive licenses. No AI-generated game art is used.

## Kenney — https://kenney.nl (CC0, public domain)
Kitchen Stove, Kitchen Cabinet, Kitchen Cabinet Drawer, Kitchen Bar (serving
counter). Via https://poly.pizza (model pages credit "Kenney", CC0).

## Quaternius — https://quaternius.com (CC0, public domain)
Kitchen Sink, Kitchen Fridge, Small Table, Round Table, Chair, Burger, Pizza.
Via https://poly.pizza (model pages credit "Quaternius", CC0).

## AI-generated UI icons (user-approved exception, 2026-10-03)
Small crisp dish + shop icons in public/icons/ (curry, noodles, burger, pizza,
tea, soup, salad, cake, table, stove, room, decor) were generated with the
media pipeline at the user's explicit request ("you can use ai if u want").
Permission covers icons and color/material enhancement ONLY. Character/scene
art and all 3D models remain hand-made as above — the sprite-sheet ban stands.

## Procedural (built in code, matching low-poly style)
Player + guest characters (cute chibi with fringe hairstyles, blush, blinking
eyes, idle animation, tintable skin/hair/shirt; player wears a staff apron),
curry / noodle / tea / soup / salad / cake dishes, inn rooms (bed, blanket,
pillows, bedside lamp, rug), pendant lamps, tablecloths, rugs, plants, shelves,
paintings, chalkboard menu, wall clock, window view, awning, outdoor grass,
trees and path, order bubbles, floor/wall canvas textures.

Thank you to all the artists who share their work freely.
